From: tobific <tobific@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] seam: required tool policy with unload-proof lifetime
 (experimental)

Adds agent/required_tool_policy.py and PluginContext.register_required_tool_policy.
A leased, task-local policy is checked at every tool dispatch point
(model_tools, tools/registry, plugin dispatch) after argument rewrites, and
stays binding until revoked, even if the plugin unloads. Used by the
orchestrator's task_authority to enforce per-task permissions.

Experimental, built against Hermes 8a3ede1b.
